  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "MG 1/100 ガンダム Mk-Vがクリアカラーになって登場！",
      "en": "MG 1/100 Gundam Mk-V now available in clear color!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• Mk-Vの特徴的な機体各部形状とディテールをマスターグレードならではの精密かつ細やかな造形で再現。",
      "en": "• The Mk-V's characteristic fuselage shape and details are reproduced with precision and detailed modeling unique to Master Grade."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 機体カラーをクリアブルーで再現。頭部、胸部、脚部などの印象的な白いラインはパーツ分割による色分け再現。",
      "en": "• The aircraft color is reproduced in clear blue. The impressive white lines on the head, chest, legs, etc. are reproduced by color-coding by dividing the parts."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• インコムを始めとした各種武装ギミックを忠実に再現。",
      "en": "• Faithfully reproduces various armed gimmicks including Incom."
    }
  ],
